OL,3,GNEWSATeen wrote murderous neo-Nazi     
OL,4,Amanifesto at home                      
OL,6,FA teenager who wrote a murderous       
OL,7,Fneo-Nazi manifesto and claimed to be a 
OL,8,Fracist will not go to prison, a judge  
OL,9,Fhas ruled.                             
OL,11,FThe youth, from Cambridgeshire,        
OL,12,Fdescribed how he would use two firearms
OL,13,Fto "kill at least 3-5 [people]" before 
OL,14,Ftaking his own life, the Old Bailey    
OL,15,Fheard.                                 
OL,17,FHe pleaded guilty to offences including
OL,18,Fcollecting information useful to a     
OL,19,Fperson preparing an act of terrorism - 
OL,20,Fand was sentenced on Thursday.         
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
