OL,4,Amanifesto at home                      
OL,6,FJudge Mark Dennis KC said it was in the
OL,7,F"best interests" of the 17-year-old and
OL,8,Fthe public to keep him out of prison,  
OL,9,Fbut made him the subject of a          
OL,10,Fthree-year youth rehabilitation order. 
